{% comment %}
  Rebrand artwork product page.

  There is no Figma frame for this page — Hanre's export covers the Store but
  stops at the grid, and "View Artwork" on those cards is a primary CTA. So
  this is assembled from the vocabulary the Store page already uses rather than
  invented: the container and gutter of every rb-* band, the IvyPresto name off
  the artist card, the teal uppercase eyebrow, the hairline rule that separates
  the two columns of the class detail band, and the moss/sage palette that runs
  through the Buy Art half of the site (the Studio half is the cherry one).

  Two deliberate departures from the Store grid, both because this page is the
  piece itself rather than a card of it:

    - the shot is CONTAINED, not cropped to a square. A card can crop; the page
      a buyer decides on cannot.
    - the gallery swaps with radio inputs and CSS, so it needs no JavaScript
      and cannot break the add-to-cart form under it.

  The artist link is resolved through a collection the piece is actually in —
  see snippets/rb-artist-handle.liquid for why handleizing the vendor is wrong
  on this catalogue.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'saf-rebrand.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign sid = section.id
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  capture artist_handle
    render 'rb-artist-handle', product: product
  endcapture
  assign artist_handle = artist_handle | strip
  assign artist_col = collections[artist_handle]

  comment
    The vendor is the artist's name on this catalogue. The collection title is
    preferred when one was found, because it is the spelling the artist's own
    page uses and the two are not always consistent.
  endcomment
  assign artist_name = product.vendor
  if artist_col != blank and artist_col.title != blank
    assign artist_name = artist_col.title
  endif

  comment
    Mediums are already carried as medium-* product tags across the whole
    catalogue (nine canonical slugs). Reading them here means the spec row is
    right on all forty works without anyone filling in a field.
  endcomment
  assign mediums = ''
  for t in product.tags
    assign lower = t | downcase
    if lower contains 'medium-'
      assign label = lower | remove_first: 'medium-' | replace: '-', ' ' | capitalize
      unless mediums contains label
        assign mediums = mediums | append: ',' | append: label
      endunless
    endif
  endfor
  assign medium_list = mediums | remove_first: ',' | split: ','

  comment
    "More by this artist" is the artist's own collection minus the piece being
    looked at — and minus their CLASSES. A person who teaches has both in one
    collection, and a class listing under "More by" on an artwork page sends a
    buyer somewhere they did not ask to go.

    Several artists only have one or two works in the catalogue right now, so
    the row would render nearly empty. Below the minimum it falls back to the
    Store collection under its own heading, which keeps the page from ending
    in a dead stop.
  endcomment
  assign skip_types = ',class,workshop,gift card,'
  assign artist_more = 0
  if artist_col != blank
    for item in artist_col.products limit: 32
      if item.id == product.id
        continue
      endif
      assign probe_type = ',' | append: item.type | downcase | append: ','
      if skip_types contains probe_type
        continue
      endif
      assign artist_more = artist_more | plus: 1
    endfor
  endif

  assign rail_col = nil
  assign rail_heading = ''
  if artist_more >= section.settings.rail_min
    assign rail_col = artist_col
    assign rail_heading = section.settings.rail_heading | replace: '[artist]', artist_name
  elsif section.settings.fallback_collection != blank
    assign rail_col = collections[section.settings.fallback_collection]
    assign rail_heading = section.settings.fallback_heading
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd {
    background: {{ section.settings.background }};
    padding-block:
      clamp(32px, 4.17vw, 80px)
      clamp(48px, 6.25vw, 120px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, {{ section.settings.media_width }}fr) minmax(0, {{ 100 | minus: section.settings.media_width }}fr);
    gap: clamp(28px, 4.17vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ---- gallery --------------------------------------------------------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__radio {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px; height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__stage {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    /* the whole piece has to be visible, so the box is a stage the artwork
       sits inside rather than a crop of it */
    min-height: clamp(300px, 34.9vw, 670px);
    background: {{ section.settings.stage_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__shot {
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: clamp(300px, 34.9vw, 670px);
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__shot {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      margin: auto;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
    }
    {%- for media in product.media -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__radio:nth-of-type({{ forloop.index }}):checked ~ .rb-pd__stage .rb-pd__shot:nth-of-type({{ forloop.index }}) {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__radio:nth-of-type({{ forloop.index }}):checked ~ .rb-pd__thumbs .rb-pd__thumb:nth-of-type({{ forloop.index }}) {
        border-color: {{ section.settings.accent_color }};
      }
    {%- endfor -%}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__shot { transition: none; }
    }
  {%- endif -%}

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__thumbs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: clamp(8px, 0.63vw, 12px);
    margin-top: clamp(10px, 0.83vw, 16px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__thumb {
    display: block;
    width: clamp(56px, 4.69vw, 90px);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.16);
    background: {{ section.settings.stage_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__thumb img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__radio:focus-visible ~ .rb-pd__thumbs .rb-pd__thumb {
    outline: 2px solid {{ section.settings.accent_color }};
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ---- detail column --------------------------------------------------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__info {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-left: clamp(0px, 3.13vw, 60px);
    {% if section.settings.show_rule %}border-left: 1px solid {{ section.settings.rule_color }};{% endif %}
    align-self: stretch;
  }
  /* A way back to the grid. The header carries no breadcrumb and this page is
     reached from a card, so without it the only route back is the browser. */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 1.25vw, 24px);
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-meta);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: {{ section.settings.artist_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__eyebrow { margin-bottom: clamp(10px, 1.04vw, 20px); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__title {
    color: {{ section.settings.title_color }};
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__artist {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ section.settings.artist_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__artist:hover { color: {{ section.settings.accent_color }}; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__artist--plain { text-decoration: none; }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__price {
    margin: clamp(14px, 1.46vw, 28px) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-label);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ section.settings.title_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__was {
    margin-left: 10px;
    opacity: 0.55;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__sold {
    margin-left: 10px;
    color: {{ section.settings.accent_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__tax {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-meta);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__specs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    margin: clamp(12px, 1.25vw, 24px) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__spec {
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body-sm);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--rb-teal);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__spec + .rb-pd__spec::before {
    content: '·';
    margin-right: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__form { margin-top: clamp(18px, 2.08vw, 40px); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__variant {
    display: block;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
    min-height: clamp(40px, 2.92vw, 56px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(10px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    padding-inline: clamp(12px, 1.04vw, 20px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.24);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body-sm);
    color: var(--rb-ink);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__qty {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 88px;
    min-height: clamp(40px, 2.92vw, 56px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(10px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    padding-inline: clamp(10px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.24);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body-sm);
    color: var(--rb-ink);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__qty-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-meta);
    color: var(--rb-ink);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__add { min-width: min(100%, 260px); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__add[disabled] {
    background: #cfcfcf;
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: default;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__desc {
    margin-top: clamp(20px, 2.29vw, 44px);
    color: {{ section.settings.body_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__desc > * { margin: 0 0 0.7em; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__desc > *:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__desc a { color: {{ section.settings.accent_color }}; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__more-link { margin-top: clamp(18px, 1.98vw, 38px); }

  /* ---- more by this artist --------------------------------------------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__rail-wrap {
    margin-top: clamp(48px, 6.25vw, 120px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__rail-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 1.72vw, 33px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__rail-title { color: {{ section.settings.rail_title_color }}; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__rail-all {
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body-sm);
    color: {{ section.settings.artist_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ section.settings.rail_columns }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 48px) clamp(16px, 2.08vw, 40px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card-media {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card-title {
    margin: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--rb-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.35vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ section.settings.title_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card-price {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-meta);
    color: {{ section.settings.body_color }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__card a:hover .rb-pd__card-title { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__info {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-pd__add { min-width: 100%; }
  }
</style>

<div class="rb-section rb-pd">
  <div class="rb-container rb-pd__grid">
    <div class="rb-pd__gallery">
      {%- if product.media.size > 0 -%}
        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            <input
              class="rb-pd__radio"
              type="radio"
              name="rb-pd-{{ sid }}"
              id="rb-pd-{{ sid }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}"
              {% if forloop.first %}checked{% endif %}
            >
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="rb-pd__stage">
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            {{
              media.preview_image
              | image_url: width: 1600
              | image_tag:
                class: 'rb-pd__shot',
                widths: '400, 600, 900, 1200, 1600',
                sizes: '(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 52vw',
                loading: 'eager',
                alt: media.preview_image.alt | default: product.title
            }}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="rb-pd__thumbs">
            {%- for media in product.media -%}
              <label class="rb-pd__thumb" for="rb-pd-{{ sid }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                {{
                  media.preview_image
                  | image_url: width: 220
                  | image_tag:
                    widths: '110, 220',
                    sizes: '90px',
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    alt: 'View image ' | append: forloop.index
                }}
              </label>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="rb-pd__stage">
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg rb-pd__shot' }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="rb-pd__info">
      {%- if section.settings.back_label != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ section.settings.back_link | default: routes.root_url }}" class="rb-pd__back">
          {{- section.settings.back_label | escape -}}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="rb-caps rb-pd__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <h1 class="rb-name rb-pd__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>

      {%- if artist_name != blank -%}
        {%- if artist_col != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ artist_col.url }}" class="rb-pd__artist">{{ artist_name }}</a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="rb-pd__artist rb-pd__artist--plain">{{ artist_name }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="rb-pd__price">
        {{- v.price | money -}}
        {%- if v.compare_at_price > v.price -%}
          <span class="rb-pd__was">{{ v.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- unless product.available -%}
          <span class="rb-pd__sold">{{ section.settings.sold_label | escape }}</span>
        {%- endunless -%}
      </p>
      {%- if section.settings.tax_note != blank -%}
        <p class="rb-pd__tax">{{ section.settings.tax_note | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if medium_list.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="rb-pd__specs" role="list">
          {%- for m in medium_list -%}
            <li class="rb-pd__spec">{{ m | strip }}</li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        A plain form post rather than Dawn's <product-form> custom element:
        the rebrand header carries no cart icon and Dawn's cart drawer is not
        part of this design, so there is nothing for an AJAX add to open. The
        post lands on the rebranded cart page, which is where the buyer is
        going next anyway, and it works with JavaScript off.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <form
        action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
        method="post"
        enctype="multipart/form-data"
        class="rb-pd__form"
      >
        {%- if product.variants.size > 1 -%}
          <label class="rb-pd__qty-label" for="rb-pd-variant-{{ sid }}">
            {{- section.settings.variant_label | escape -}}
          </label>
          <select class="rb-pd__variant" id="rb-pd-variant-{{ sid }}" name="id">
            {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
              <option
                value="{{ variant.id }}"
                {% if variant == v %}selected{% endif %}
                {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
              >
                {{ variant.title }} — {{ variant.price | money }}
                {%- unless variant.available %} ({{ section.settings.sold_label }}){% endunless -%}
              </option>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </select>
        {%- else -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}">
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.show_quantity -%}
          <label class="rb-pd__qty-label" for="rb-pd-qty-{{ sid }}">
            {{- section.settings.quantity_label | escape -}}
          </label>
          <input
            class="rb-pd__qty"
            id="rb-pd-qty-{{ sid }}"
            type="number"
            name="quantity"
            value="1"
            min="1"
            step="1"
          >
        {%- else -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
        {%- endif -%}

        <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="{{ routes.cart_url }}">

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="rb-btn rb-btn--{{ section.settings.button_fill }} rb-pd__add"
          {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
        >
          {%- if product.available -%}
            {{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}
          {%- else -%}
            {{ section.settings.sold_label | escape }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </button>
      </form>

      {%- if product.description != blank -%}
        <div class="rb-body rb-pd__desc">{{ product.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if artist_col != blank and section.settings.artist_link_label != blank -%}
        <div class="rb-pd__more-link">
          <a href="{{ artist_col.url }}" class="rb-btn rb-btn--serif rb-btn--outline">
            {{- section.settings.artist_link_label | replace: '[artist]', artist_name | escape -}}
          </a>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if rail_col != nil and rail_heading != blank -%}
    <div class="rb-container rb-pd__rail-wrap">
      <div class="rb-pd__rail-head">
        <h2 class="rb-section-title rb-pd__rail-title">{{ rail_heading | escape }}</h2>
        <a href="{{ rail_col.url }}" class="rb-pd__rail-all">
          {{- section.settings.rail_link_label | escape -}}
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="rb-pd__cards">
        {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
        {%- for item in rail_col.products -%}
          {%- if item.id == product.id -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign probe_type = ',' | append: item.type | downcase | append: ',' -%}
          {%- if skip_types contains probe_type -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if shown >= section.settings.rail_count -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
          <article class="rb-pd__card">
            <a href="{{ item.url }}">
              <span class="rb-media rb-pd__card-media">
                {%- if item.featured_image != blank -%}
                  {{
                    item.featured_image
                    | image_url: width: 700
                    | image_tag:
                      widths: '220, 340, 520, 700',
                      sizes: '(max-width: 749px) 45vw, 22vw',
                      loading: 'lazy',
                      alt: item.featured_image.alt | default: item.title
                  }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <h3 class="rb-pd__card-title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
              <p class="rb-pd__card-price">
                {{- item.price | money -}}
                {%- unless item.available %} · {{ section.settings.sold_label }}{% endunless -%}
              </p>
            </a>
          </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Rebrand artwork",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "rb-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The artwork product page. The artist name, link, mediums and 'more by' row all resolve from the product, so one template serves every piece." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "back_label", "default": "← Back to the Store", "label": "Back link label",
      "info": "Blank hides it. The header has no breadcrumb, so this is the only route back to the grid." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "back_link", "label": "Back link" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "eyebrow", "default": "Original Artwork", "label": "Eyebrow",
      "info": "Uppercase teal line above the title. Words wrapped in <strong> render cherry." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sold_label", "default": "Sold", "label": "Sold label" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tax_note", "label": "Note under the price",
      "info": "For example: Excludes delivery. Leave blank to hide." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buying" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "default": "Add to Cart", "label": "Add to cart label" },
